{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>開羅名作限時免費！你是否曾經幻想過打造一間讓學生流連忘返的夢幻校園？《口袋學院物語2》正是為你實現這個願望的經營模擬遊戲，現在正處於限時免費階段，適合所有喜愛策略建造與校園題材的玩家立即下載。</p>\n\n<h2>打造專屬名牌學府</h2>\n<p>遊戲讓你可以自由設置走廊與教室，從零開始規劃校園佈局，逐步建立屬於自己的名牌學校。本作更升級加入了交通工具、戀愛元素以及社團活動，讓校園生活更加豐富多元。透過舉辦「球技大賽」或「藝術鑑賞教室」等日常活動，能夠有效吸引更多學生入學，並見證他們朝著志願邁進的青春故事。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://twstatic.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2048x2732bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：口袋學院物語2</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store | Google Play</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-03T07:59:30.959364+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}